{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:00 2026-10-24 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏肚皮驚現「神秘怪圈」惹揣測  峇里度假再派絕色福利圖  比堅尼放題秀色可餐\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08f9340b53af7eda3f41b4bd62e9a029/2026-10/51_0_4.jpg\"/>\n<p>現年41歲的前港姐「最上鏡小姐」袁嘉敏（Candy），近年自英國回流返港後人氣持續高企，除了內地商演登台接踵而來，其個人付費相片平台亦吸金力驚人。向來不吝嗇展現本錢的她，近日飛赴印尼峇里島度假，早前一段「零吊帶」貝殼比堅尼震撼短片引爆全網熱話後，日前她再度加碼大派福利，接連換上火辣泳裝大曬魔鬼身材。豈料在一片讚嘆聲中，有眼利網民竟發現其腹部離奇浮現怪異圓圈，瞬間掀起熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>袁嘉敏流露極致風情</h2>\n<p>鏡頭前的袁嘉敏顏值狀態大勇，面部肌膚緊緻透亮、蘋果肌飽滿，絲毫看不出年過四十的痕跡。身處充滿原始風情的原木浴室內，她面對落地全身鏡表現得自信從容，時而微露皓齒展現嫵媚甜笑，時而以深邃迷離的眼神直勾勾電暈鏡頭。她輕輕撥弄微濕長髮，緩緩側身擺動胴體，舉手投足間皆流露出成熟女性的極致風情。</p>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏近日穿上中門大開戰衣性感值爆燈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b476892f2eeb4c37a6ba44cb77e1df2e/2026-07/1_4_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏到內地登台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23abcba4136e915fc8a95364439725a4/2026-07/4_5_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏的貝殼比堅尼超性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/acd37fdae5ccb77913267fdd84c27d83/2026-10/a1_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏的貝殼比堅尼難遮性感身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2eb4f751eeeaeaec8475a2e7368f1d24/2026-10/a2_0_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏身在峇里度假，再次連環派性感泳衣福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/19ebffd8cb5b796df47f071d0ca50bd5/2026-10/1_4_7.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏身材無敵。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68aae26181a1f98eba96ca27eb625e25/2026-10/4_10_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏被指肚驚現「神秘怪圈」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1693ad0fb625b02dbd6abaff8cb26bdd/2026-10/5_9_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏和海報合影，被指真人狀態出現嚴重落差。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac55ae0c541ca7fa8f30ab1c43ecfa30/2026-07/5_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏早前分享旅遊曼谷的性感照片，低胸吊帶衫極度吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/392c15f051d1f7f5f429e60dbbd632ca/2026-05/3897623519060266175_1686632994.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏穿上細碼吊帶衫，只能包裹一半豐滿上圍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc3fcad0648287f19547f76d27b4cf40/2026-05/3897623522717522627_1686632994.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏今次的靚相未見泳衣照，網民估計她留在付費頻道才展示。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a6a39d6a06e9fd245f16362e5705e64/2026-05/3897623525670308743_1686632994.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏近日被指收入下滑，馬上分享旅遊照打破傳聞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9bf2317fba01b5f5d5f7db2756c1837/2026-05/3897623533580723814_1686632994.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏的薄紗吊帶衫，半透明若隱若現，甚為誘惑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ed664f9d9e4c5aed11eb420caec2f0e/2026-05/3897623571346422699_1686632994.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏不時以超性感戰衣騷身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05c790131b7567d307893f96045e095f/2026-02/J1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏身材好誘人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05b7de2d690640ad359c3bc863b28a6c/2026-02/J2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏保養得宜不似41歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65af1c377d75a01f4ae93a72d52f7915/2026-02/J3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏身材令人抖不過氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d427a9d74e75a8b5ef1b5758740b245/2026-02/J5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏美不勝收。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c87c9c6fccb68c7d5088ae47ccdc5db5/2026-02/J6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏另一套黑色戰衣一樣無敵。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/276fabb6b209d40dcef8ba6cb625481f/2026-02/J8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏上圍極澎湃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e8b63816ac45b7134dc888969fa62bac/2026-02/J9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏疑似真空上陣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d5077b72117ee530b7eb9e8185797d5/2026-02/J10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏身材一流。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4460b6c83d71c3d14dd6a023b90197c8/2025-10/ck01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏多角度任睇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e964c5bcf66bb65c1ff0b764fac9ea6/2025-10/ck03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏懂得發揮優點。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3aa197b9057c3a4b36fe5fb0f378ab4a/2025-10/ck06.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏用「胸」器吸引網民關注。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63064fba29bf23d046d28ccbb557fd7b/2025-10/ck09.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏身材極好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5825814290e6d086846ad02cad0b0b22/2025-10/ck10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏經營Patreon，大晒性感火辣泳照吸金。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ddd24f5a91191cf6b944dcf6db004d7/2026-05/3693969762765056143_1686632994.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏頻頻拍片晒財力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7466eed23c31bc3cd1f79fdad249e93/2026-01/VS----1_19__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏曾到內地獻唱，於台上疑「上下失守」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44ff4aaf1a6780af8d4fe5c7bf0a78f9/2026-02/67_0.jpg\"/>\n<h2>袁嘉敏性感泳衣美不勝收</h2>\n<p>這次曝光的泳裝同樣極具視覺震撼。她最初以一條黃白相間的沙灘巾半裹胴體，營造若隱若現的誘人神秘感；隨後她大方褪下掩護，展現出一套剪裁大膽的三點式戰衣。其呼之欲出的傲人身材，與緊緻腰身形成強烈視覺反差，極致豐滿的S形曲線性感到令人噴血。</p>\n<h2>袁嘉敏腹部現神秘怪圈？</h2>\n<p>然而，當網民放大照片細看時，焦點卻意外落在她的腰腹位置。在其平坦的肚皮中央，竟突兀地浮現出一圈輪廓分明的不明圓形陰影與肌肉斷層線條，與正常人體的腹肌結構大相徑庭。這道奇特痕跡引來不少網民質疑，猜測她是否為了追求極致纖腰而在推脂修飾時用力過猛，亦有網民則懷疑她「修圖過度」。儘管肚皮異狀引發廣泛揣測，但多數粉絲依然大讚她保養得宜，性感魅力絲毫不減當年。</p>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏不時挑戰性感尺度。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fff2b70b3063db9b97f5ae1379a27a69/2025-12/EP33-4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏坦言，不喜歡與比自己年輕的男生拍拖，但風趣地透露現時仍有24歲的「小鮮肉」向她示好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53be15e4ca1e4c0fed8214eb2ee6fb1a/2025-12/EP33-5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏自揭基層童年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f65f6fb4719ff3385d29572087cb44b/2025-12/EP33-1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏登台曾遭非禮兼被潑不明液體。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b9f039951930428a2fc35c9c9f61009/2025-12/EP33-2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏財來自有方。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c9fc2fdd3cac4ccb23d5d37e30bd624/2025-09/a2_27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏曝光新居。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5944b2ffd88a1132c1966d7328523e9f/2025-09/a9_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏新居盡覽靚海景。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ebb31c5fed000d735cfc7c8ac2c085db/2025-07/V5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏2022年4月1日突然在IG貼相炮轟鍾培生父子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f070e565dfeeff660feae278e459a573/2022-12/yuen_ig_1.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏貼出鍾培生的家庭相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35912a7e3bbc8af5b8478e6870fac3c6/2022-12/yuen_ig_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏炮轟鍾培生父子，引起全城討論。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2990512e71fb6ed10da0c39e751f6ed/2022-12/yuen_ig_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏早前到內地商演。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df112626eeb735ee2864fe660338c498/2025-10/CANDY_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏到內地夜場演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dbd815f2e2ed3c8c233b633acc5089fd/2025-10/CANDY_1__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏穿上超低胸緊身晚裝裙現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6722b3b1f0d545d6120fa3e3b2e7eb5d/2025-10/CANDY_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏俯身密密簽名。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d76902ec2dee561539264fc98150a77/2025-10/CANDY_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏不時展示豐滿身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/787e9eb23daf9d0660f2d022227139b5/2022-12/yuen_ig_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏曾旅居海外，2023年底宣布定居英國倫敦生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ce1b3c88ffc132ed5bc2673588124be/2022-12/yuen_ig_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏落選後曾在TVB拍劇，其中在《潛行狙擊》因Laughing嫂一角被觀眾留意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ff8d6d6a6b3d14b06847523ef180e5c/2025-02/17_600.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏離巢後，2015年接拍三級片《鴨王》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3a47487bddb8e582a6468eea288ce9ec/2022-12/duck_king_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏在社交網拍片，見她扮靚靚去應酬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec99b72fef287676f57a2317406a637c/2025-02/VS----0_29__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏突然指這些生活片段，將成為她在倫敦的最後回憶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8e5d6b3fd908fc5d565b75be93af76e/2025-02/VS----0_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏身穿入膊貼身裙見朋友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de79424c4147ecf328e31e340d6e4e27/2025-02/VS----0_54__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏指自己將會回到亞洲生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95cc4fe91ef0b4b7edcda6f73b4f0ce1/2025-02/VS----0_59_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏透露離開的原因：「也許是英國漫長的寒冷氣候，每天都是穿着厚厚的冬衣，令我渴望回到温暖熱情的亞洲。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa3a449b143008350625d37d0ae0f45f/2025-02/VS----1_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏指很榮幸可以在這地方住上了一段寧靜安逸的日子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb7c4dcd8ca987cd937bd61c0a465845/2025-02/VS----2_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏曾參加了一個高級會所「Annabel's」的新年倒數派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4106e4add75ff1b6a3bd172c862e5de/2025-02/VS--CandyYuencandykamanyuenInstagram-0_07_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁嘉敏指派對本應凌晨三點結束，但自己一點左右已離開，因為要不停與人交際應酬需要不少能量。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76634926c0661bc0c7fae14b059e6621/2025-02/VS--YouTube-NewYearPartyatLondonsmostexclusiveprivateclub-2_59_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T13:20:05.447649+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":685,"images":56,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T14:18:21.583900+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T13:15:37.487103+00:00","content_hash":"e8475b5ac14e1b295b6108e25b8cf011240e8529245528f0c7e3463f7fde7f30","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}